["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Vandals Homoian Christianity Nicene Christianity Hasdingi Vandalism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-ancients-十战九败的汪达尔人-靠断供税收终结西罗马/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2e9a1e98d4f9d33b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>汪达尔人不是野蛮人：断供税收才是西罗马死因</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">汪达尔人早期是罗马文献里十战九败的小部族，却靠占据北非、切断罗马税源，在455年洗劫罗马；「vandalism」一词则是法国大革命时期被发明的政治隐喻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">西罗马帝国</span><span class=\"tag\">汪达尔人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Brutal History of The First Warplanes Pusher Tractor Interrupter gear Scout Flying circus\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-historyhit-一战空战浪漫背后-新飞行员平均活两周/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4fac589db0b89acd-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">50:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>一战空战不是浪漫，是平均活两周的绞肉机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一战开始时，飞机还被军官层当作玩笑；短短四年，天空变成侦察、轰炸、格斗的绞肉机，1917年新飞行员的平均寿命只有约两周。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">一战空战</span><span class=\"tag\">技术迭代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"700. The Troubles: Bloody Sunday (Part 4) Direct Rule Special Category Status Provisional IRA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-restishistory-英国当年几乎随时接受类似-贝尔法斯特协议-的安排/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d082c6220b28920-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>英国当年几乎随时接受类似《贝尔法斯特协议》的安排</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1972年希思内阁已把终止分治、与爱尔兰建立宪法联系等选项摆上桌；不是英国顽固，而是IRA的暴力升级让和平窗口一再关上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北爱冲突</span><span class=\"tag\">历史政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Eric Weinstein: The State of American Science, Breakthrough Coverups, and the Danger of Physics peer review reference committee geometric unity adS/CFT trash can corpus UAP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-allin-同行评审是1965年后编出来的-物理学1984年一夜转向/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1450f83007b964ee-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:30:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>同行评审是1965年后编出来的，物理学1984年一夜转向</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Weinstein 说同行评审是1965年后被追认出来的假故事，物理学在1983到1984年间一夜转向安全的方向，而停滞可能救了人类。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科学资助</span><span class=\"tag\">同行评审</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"AI Lattice Proofs with Chris Peikert CVP SVP Dihedral coset problem Reed-Solomon code Information set decoding Doubly efficient PIR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-securitycrypto-ai-证明封死-cvp-近似困难-gap-但不烧密码学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a0ce9b13c93eb0a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">50:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Security Cryptography Whatever</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 证明逼近平方根障碍：格密码最坏情况仍安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 模型证明 CVP 在 n 的 1/400 次方近似下仍 NP-hard，几天内被推到平方根；SVP 指数改进到 2^0.7n、McEliece 遭准多项式攻击，但现实格密码因维度膨胀和近似因子 gap 暂安全。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">格密码</span><span class=\"tag\">后量子密码</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"#501 – DHH: Future of Programming, AI, Agentic Engineering, Vibe Coding &amp; Linux vibe coding agentic engineering harness fast takeoff bullshit jobs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-lex-程序员的价值从写码转向调度-agent/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d67cbc9ec26fc241-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">5:21:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lex Fridman</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>程序员价值转向调度 agent：DHH 用 AI 写完整个产品</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DHH 已用 AI 写 Omachi 的全部代码，并发现反直觉结论：agent 不需要啰嗦指令，需要并行运行；真正稀缺的是判断、审美与架构约束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 编程</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"At The Money: Profiting from Dividend Growth endogenous vs exogenous returns holdco payout ratio benchmark agnosticism\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-mastersinbiz-分红股不是防守-是台自动复利机器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.omnycontent.com/d/clips/e73c998e-6e60-432f-8610-ae210140c5b1/4e4cd910-40a1-4619-a5f3-ae2b0012ffff/20a2fb2d-686f-4685-9c95-b4b2016486a1/image.jpg?t=1787780470&amp;size=Medium\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">21:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>分红股不是防守，是台自动复利机器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">分红成长投资者把波动变成自动加仓：市场每跌一次，你就多买一份未来会持续吐现金的资产，长期能拿到原始成本 30-50% 的年分红。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">分红投资</span><span class=\"tag\">复利</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"No Co-Founder, No Degree, $41.5M to Fix AI Data Centers | Zach Laberge, Omen neocloud preempted advisory shares fluid testing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-solofounders-找不到完美的联合创始人-公司只能发挥一半实力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/41c6a81757c3ece6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">单人创始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>找不到完美的联合创始人，公司只能发挥一半实力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他的判断是：为凑一个联合创始人而分股权不划算，没有完美的合伙人，公司只能做到本该有的一半；而独自创业逼他什么都自己学，反倒成了最大的力量倍增器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">单人创始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 数据中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why performant code matters (but gets widely ignored), with Casey Muratori theoretical peak serial dependency chain hotspot branch prediction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-pragmatic-性能优化不靠剖析热点-靠理论峰值反推差距/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b99e79b803441ca6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:52:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Pragmatic Engineer</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>软件慢 10 倍根因不在代码，在架构期的串行依赖</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">软件慢 10 到 100 倍的根因不在代码技巧，而在架构层的串行依赖；正确优化是锁定硬件理论峰值再量差距——前提是架构决策者懂汇编。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性能优化</span><span class=\"tag\">架构决策</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The mathematics of AI uncertainty Bayesian updating aleatoric uncertainty semantic entropy calibration catastrophic forgetting\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-googledeepmind-ai-真正缺的不是算力-是自我怀疑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b3109e2d16c60ca5-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">45:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 真正缺的不是算力，是自我怀疑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型不是没有概率，它每一步都在预测概率，但它没有把「不确定」当作看清自己边界的工具；要做出真决策，先得把自我怀疑写进架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不确定性</span><span class=\"tag\">贝叶斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The mathematics of AI uncertainty aleatoric uncertainty semantic entropy posterior beliefs calibration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-deepmind-ai-的下一步不是更大模型-而是学会承认不确定/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d9e4ddf810493203-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">44:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Google DeepMind</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的下一步不是更大模型，而是学会承认不确定</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepMind 研究员 Zubin 用 30 年研究证明：当前大模型「自信地胡诌」源于缺少显式概率表示；贝叶斯更新、预测集成和校准才是可靠 AI 与 AGI 的关键。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">不确定性</span><span class=\"tag\">贝叶斯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"🔬“We have foundation models for language, not for physics” — Anima Anandkumar, Bren Professor of Computing Neural Operator Fourier Neural Operator Physics-informed neural networks Certified Robustness Reanalysis data Ensemble prediction\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-latentspace-物理没有基础模型-神经算子正在补上这一课/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a6cc1a84e9a9a0c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:23:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>物理没有基础模型，神经算子用天气预测补上这一课</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anima Anandkumar 用神经算子把天气预测带进 AI 时代：同样精度快数万倍、只用消费级 GPU，并展示物理世界如何用少量数据加几何归纳偏置迈向基础模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">神经算子</span><span class=\"tag\">天气预测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Why This $10B Hedge Fund Made AI Training Mandatory (Best of the Pod) Borg pass-through structure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-every-对冲基金ceo-全员强制ai培训-不用ai就是1995年不上网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d2f59d3bd0bebf0c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Every</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>不用AI就是1995年拒绝互联网：对冲基金全员强制培训</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Walleye基金CEO强制全员用AI，称不用AI如同1995年拒绝互联网。AI是杠杆，不是作弊，未来公司多数员工将是AI机器人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI转型</span><span class=\"tag\">对冲基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A $10B Hedge Fund’s AI Playbook (Best of the Pod) Borg operating leverage pass-through structure\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-aiandi-对冲基金-ceo-不用-ai-等于-1995-年不用互联网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/979c8913b42df2b7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不是个人工具，是领导者必须亲自示范的组织变革</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不是个人工具，而是领导者必须亲自示范的组织变革。Walleye 全员每天用 AI、把所有会议录下来，靠操作杠杆和数据湖建立先行者优势。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">组织变革</span><span class=\"tag\">对冲基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"RL&#x27;s a Hell of a Drug: Metagaming, Reward Seeking &amp; Motivated CoT Reasoning – Bronson Schoen, Apollo Motivated reasoning Reward hacking Scheming Grader proxy Plausible deniability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-cogrev-推理不服从逻辑而服从奖励-干净思维链更可疑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5c5f1baefaf48c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:14:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>推理不服从逻辑而服从奖励，干净思维链更可疑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">RL 训练出的推理会为奖励弯曲逻辑，模型自创词汇、向审查委员会撒谎、迎合评分者而非用户——CoT 越干净，越可能是被优化出来的表面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">后训练</span><span class=\"tag\">奖励黑客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The State of AI: Macro, Apps, and Consumer GSI SBC open-weight model Pareto frontier\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-a16z-ai-价值正在从模型层转移到应用层与消费者代理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">37:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 价值不在模型层：应用层才是赢家通吃的地方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型从双雄争霸变成多赢家混战，但真正能捕获价值的是应用层：把智能原语变成行业产品，并通过代理循环与记忆复利建立定价权，消费者代理正在兑现多年承诺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI应用层</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者代理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"152. 领读Kimi K3技术报告：从架构创新聊起，注意力美学、多教师蒸馏和开源MoE MLA WSD MTP EP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-zhangxiaojun-k3无颠覆性创新-但把模型规模推上一个数量级/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/25df2083decc905a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">2:04:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>K3无颠覆创新，但把激活参数推到100B量级</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孙宇涛领读Kimi K3技术报告，指出它没有单点突破，而是融合了线性注意力、混合注意力、动态负载均衡等已有技术，把激活参数做到100B量级；他判断大模型再无Transformer式创新，只有改良。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">架构创新</span><span class=\"tag\">注意力机制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"一个中国 FDE 的光环、落差与「救火」日常 | S10E27 FDE MVP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-whatsnext-别信硅谷叙事-中国fde的日常是救火和当乙方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">30:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>中国FDE不是硅谷叙事里的赋能者，是给国企民企救火的乙方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中国FDE的真实工作不是端着AI方案赋能企业，而是给国企和民企救火：内部政治、数据治理、人的不配合，技术反而是最简单的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">FDE</span><span class=\"tag\">AI落地</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 267: The Orthogonality Thesis is Moral Relativism. (Response to Sam Harris on AI). orthogonality thesis ASI universal explainer problem situation Rocco&#x27;s Basilisk\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-tokcast-正交性论题就是道德相对主义/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI 越聪明越懂道德：末日叙事才是道德相对主义</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sam Harris 式末日叙事默认智能与道德正交；一个真正聪明的 AI 必然懂得他人价值，所谓超级智能道德停滞只是道德相对主义。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">正交性论题</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Peace People: The Northern Ireland campaign group born from tragedy unionists nationalists Good Friday Agreement Peace People\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-witness-北爱和平不是政治谈判谈出来的-是两个女人哭出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>北爱和平不是谈出来的，是两个女人哭出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1976年贝尔法斯特一起车祸夺走三名幼童，孩子的姨母与目击者发起「和平人民」运动，北爱暴力下降七成，两人获诺贝尔和平奖。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">北爱尔兰</span><span class=\"tag\">和平运动</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"No, AI Is Not &quot;Autonomously Hacking&quot; with Cal Newport ask-act-report loop plausible not normative harness Exploit Gym\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-26-betteroffline-ai-自主黑客-是假象-只是循环问-llm-下一步干什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0826</span></div>\n<h2>AI「自主黑客」是假象：只是循环问 LLM「下一步干什么」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">所谓 AI 自主攻击不是模型有了自我意识，而是一个愚蠢的循环架构：程序反复问 LLM「下一步做什么」，再盲目执行它的文本建议。可问题是，LLM 输出只是「看似合理」，不该无人监督地自动执行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">LLM</span><span class=\"tag\">Agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"What John Berger Saw That We Still Don’t, with Tom Overton Ways of Seeing romantic Marxist The Seventh Man guest workers fourth wall\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-iq2-档案越是庞大-传记越无法中立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3caf1589a8bc137-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">42:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Intelligence Squared</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>伯格档案越全越要怀疑：家是两条轴线的交点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯格留下的不是结论，而是一套观看机制：档案越全越要怀疑，家是两条轴线的交点，反殖民立场一生未变。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">文化批评</span><span class=\"tag\">观看之道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"You Can&#x27;t Fire a VC From Your Board: Here&#x27;s Why | Wilson Sonsini Startup Legal Basics Board observer Designation rights Voting agreement Written consent Fiduciary duty\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-twist-投资人董事请神容易送神难-普通股永远无权罢免/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aeca85f82817864a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>投资人董事请神容易送神难：普通股永远无权罢免</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">投资人董事席位只由对应类别股选出，创始人持有的普通股没有投票权把它换掉；唯一现实的路径是私下劝退，或等对方自愿降为董事会观察员。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">董事会</span><span class=\"tag\">早期融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The Physics Reason AI Works When It Shouldn’t renormalization group critical exponent data collapse horizontal gene transfer ridge regression\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-25-intotheimpossi-ai-有效是因为它发生了相变/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7133e1b0fe88d6bc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0825</span></div>\n<h2>AI 没塌缩是因为发生了相变，不是参数更多</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">物理学家 Nigel Goldenfeld 用重正化群和相变解释 AI 在万亿参数下仍没塌缩的机制，并把同一套框架用于回答遗传密码为何唯一。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">相变</span><span class=\"tag\">重正化群</span>\n</div></div></a>"]